  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Planets <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> orbit the same star. The average distance between planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> and the star is 3 times greater than the distance between planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> and the star.</p>\n<p>What is the ratio of the orbital period of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> to the orbital period of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> ?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[3]{3}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[3]{9}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[]{27}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
